        "markdown": "[Home](/) · [Schedule](/schedule) · [Pricing](/pricing) · [Retreats](/retreats)\n\n# Flamands Yoga Shala\n\nOpen-air yoga above Flamands beach. All levels, all ages, barefoot.\n\n## Classes\n\n- Morning vinyasa (7am, Monday to Saturday)\n- Sunset yin (5:30pm, Tuesday and Thursday)\n- Beach yoga on Sundays at 8am\n- Private sessions at your villa\n\n## Pricing\n\n- Drop-in class: €28\n- 5-class pass: €125 (valid 2 months)\n- 10-class pass: €230 (valid 4 months)\n- Private session: €120 per hour, up to 4 people\n- Mats provided free of charge.\n\nBook your spot on https://www.momoyoga.example/flamands-shala — classes are capped at 12 people.\n\n## Teachers\n\n- Ana Costa, founder, 500h RYT\n- Ben Fischer, yin and meditation\n\n## Retreats\n\nThree-day retreats in May and October, from €890 per person including meals and accommodation.\n\n\"The sunset yin class with the ocean in front of you is pure magic.\" — Kate M., Toronto\n\nFlamands Yoga Shala, Anse des Flamands, 97133 Saint-Barthélemy · WhatsApp +590 690 00 34 56 · hello@flamandsyoga.example\n\nClasses are taught in English; Ana also teaches in Portuguese and French.\n\n© Flamands Yoga Shala · Terms · Privacy"
